{"id": "UgyBe9TezotE2LjN8Pd4AaABAg.AWL4pTxqc3ZAWQz8pfy7lJ", "parent": "UgyBe9TezotE2LjN8Pd4AaABAg", "likes": 2, "text": "시도했는데  실패했음...꽁부쫌하고  댓글다시오", "published": "2026-05-05T14:35:01", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugx240FM1j7a_E2fr_F4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 6, "text": "미군들은\n남의나라을\n왜 작구 \n빼앗으려고할까\n베트남 🇻🇳 사람들도\n너무 고생했네요", "published": "2026-05-02T10:35:20", "replies": 4, "creator": false}
